  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming mission for women Jordan (JEBA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The study visit aims to bring together successful young female business owners from various competitive sectors in Jordan, such as Fashion, Design, Architecture, Art, Health and Wellness, Information Technology (IT), and Agri-food. The purpose is to facilitate the exchange of ideas, technical expertise, and sector-specific knowledge between these entrepreneurs and their counterparts in the Netherlands. Additionally, the visit aims to explore potential collaborations and market opportunities, promote Jordanian female-owned businesses in the Netherlands, and address the gender-specific challenges faced by female entrepreneurs in both countries. Furthermore, the study visit also seeks to foster long-term business relationships between Jordanian female business owners and Dutch companies.</narrative>
  </description>
